  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;....(i)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;.....(ii)</p><p>Now subtracting equation (ii) from (i) we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>.</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>19</mn><